    - Focus-visible: global :focus-visible outline + box-shadow rings on .btn/.dropzone/a.
    - Print: @media print hides .upload-section, .upload-alt, .topbar-actions, all .btn, .toast, .overlay; cards go white, break-inside: avoid, chart keeps height.
    
